# 🚀 End-to-End AWS DevOps CI/CD & GitOps Project

## 📌 Project Overview

I implemented an end-to-end DevOps CI/CD pipeline to automate application build, code quality analysis, Docker image creation, and deployment to Amazon EKS.

This project integrates Jenkins, GitHub Webhooks, SonarQube, Docker, AWS ECR, Kubernetes, and Argo CD to demonstrate a practical DevOps workflow.

## 🏗️ Project Architecture

