## 🧰 Troubleshooting & Challenges

During implementation, I encountered and investigated:

- Jenkins and GitHub integration issues.
- SonarQube connectivity and configuration.
- ECR image authentication and push issues.
- EKS node group configuration.
- Kubernetes Pod scheduling errors caused by maximum Pod capacity.
- Argo CD Degraded health status during rolling updates.
- Kubernetes Deployment rolling update strategy.

I configured `maxSurge: 0` and `maxUnavailable: 1` in the Deployment strategy to help perform rolling updates without requiring an additional Pod slot.

